        {
          "id": "BF-D01",
          "kind": "diagnose",
          "goal": "先取目标和耗尽配置再定位空结果",
          "prompt": "Investigate the supplied missing-result symptom. Ask for target behavior, full decorator options and event/caller evidence before selecting a cause. Diagnose disclosed evidence or close with an evidence plan if unavailable. Do not change files.",
